<title>RUSSIA: Russian GDP fell six pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Russian GDP fell six pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian gross domestic product fell six percent in 1996 from 1995, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>December GDP was four percent above the level in November 1996 and four percent below the level in December 1995.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN GDP			  Dec 1996  Nov 1995  Dec 1995</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	+4	  -2	  +1</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	  -4	  -7	  -6</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
